    """POST a list of BLS series ids and an inclusive year range. Returns the requested observations keyed by series id under `Results.series[]`. Unauthenticated calls are rate-limited to 25/day per IP and to a 10-year max range; authenticated calls (with `registrationkey`) extend to 500/day and 20 years."""
    params = dict(state.get("params") or {})
